import { VStack, Text } from 'vune-ui'; import PageWithHeader from '@/components/global/vune/PageWithHeader.vune'; import MkInfo from '@/components/vune/MkInfo.vune'; import MkInput from '@/components/vune/MkInput.vune'; import { i18n } from '@/i18n.js'; import type { PageHeaderItem } from '@/types/page-header.js';
type Props={tab:string;searchProps:Record<string,unknown>;notesAvailable?:boolean;usersAvailable?:boolean;ignoreNotesAvailable?:boolean;headerActions?:PageHeaderItem[];headerTabs?:any[];onTabChange?:(v:string)=>void}; function tab(props:Props,v:string){props.onTabChange?.(v)}
export struct VuneSearchView: View { let props:Props; init(_ props:Props){self.props=props} var body:some View { PageWithHeader(pageMetadata:null,tab:props.tab,actions:props.headerActions??[],tabs:props.headerTabs??[],swipable:true,onTab:{v in tab(props,v)}){VStack(alignment: 'stretch', spacing: 0){if(props.tab==='note'){if(props.notesAvailable||props.ignoreNotesAvailable){MkInput(String(props.searchProps.query??''),readonly:true,label:Text(i18n.ts.search));Text(i18n.ts.notes)}else{MkInfo(warn:true){Text(i18n.ts.notesSearchNotAvailable)}}}else{if(props.usersAvailable){MkInput(String(props.searchProps.query??''),readonly:true,label:Text(i18n.ts.search));Text(i18n.ts.users)}else{MkInfo(warn:true){Text(i18n.ts.usersSearchNotAvailable)}}}}.className('_spacer _gaps_m').style({'--MI_SPACER-w':'800px'})} } }
export default VuneSearchView
